  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.4.2: DapperAuditRepository and DapperAuditStartupValidator close the connection after every operation (unless the caller passed it already open), so audited writes no longer keep pooled connections busy until garbage collection and can no longer exhaust the host connection pool. 2.4.0: DapperAuditUnitOfWork now resolves the configured WithReference selector and forwards it to IAuditService, so SourceReference (the human-readable entity name) is persisted for Dapper-tracked entities — previously it was always null. Requires AuditaX 2.4.0. 2.3.1: Republish bump aligned with AuditaX 2.3.1 (version-only). 2.3.0 introduced SourceReference widening to 512.",
